OL,3,GNEWSAFlu and discharge waits cause
OL,4,Ahospital bed shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore patients are waiting in emergency
OL,7,Fdepartments without a bed due to rising
OL,8,Fflu cases and delays to discharges, NHS
OL,9,Fbosses have said.
OL,11,FGloucestershire Hospitals NHS
OL,12,FFoundation Trust said last week about
OL,13,F150 patients were medically fit to
OL,14,Fleave its hospitals but remained on
OL,15,Fwards, while about 60 beds were taken
OL,16,Fup by flu patients.
OL,18,FEmergency department staff are having
OL,19,Fto care for patients in corridors at
OL,20,Fpeak times as about 30 people a day are
OL,21,Fwaiting for a bed, the trust added.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
