OL,3,GNEWSAFlu and discharge waits cause
OL,4,Ahospital bed shortage
OL,5,
OL,6,FGloucestershire Health and Care NHS
OL,7,FFoundation Trust, which runs the
OL,8,Fcounty's community care - often the
OL,9,Fnext step after hospital care - said it
OL,10,Fwas working to reduce delays.
